# AI Tools (LLM proofreading + Markdown generation)

Admin batch feature that calls an OpenAI-compatible LLM over the selected questions to (a) **proofread** a typed version's images against an official scan, or (b) **transcribe** images into a Markdown asset. Runs stream a live SSE log with a real server-side Stop.

